OL,3,GNEWSATrust warns of 'tangible' climate
OL,4,Athreat to heritage sites
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlooding could also undermine
OL,7,Ffoundations, while hotter, dry
OL,8,Fconditions could increase the risk of
OL,9,Fsubsidence and wildfires.
